{"parentUuid":"e27e8187-05bc-458d-9363-c313bd9e4769","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZuoHk8HWVVdreLiVSmH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2C.1: GATE PASSED\n\nPushed to `phase-2c-reader` at `fc26372`; `ls-remote` shows the same commit. There's no PR, and nothing has been labelled for gold.\n\n- **Draw** (`984ae90`, after `POLICY.md` at `6cd57e2`): 300 gold and 150 dev articles in 17 strata. Each article's inclusion weight is in `split.json`, and `HASH` matches it.\n- **Leakage:** `check_leakage.py` exits 0. Its rule is at least 5 shared five-word runs, making up 10% of the shorter text. It flags all 603 one-story pairs in decision 36's randomly drawn strata. It also set aside 1,196 pool articles the grouping missed, mostly short repeated adverts and columns.\n- **Expected reports in gold:** about 35 at the judged rates, before E8 and E6, which no judged item measures. At 35 reports, a field right in 30 of them has an interval of 71–94%.\n- **Dev:** I label it by hand under `POLICY.md` in 2C.2.\n- **Labelling page** (`scripts/label_gold.py`): runs locally, crops come through `crops_for`, and one real article loaded correctly.\n- 365 tests pass and lint is clean.\n\nOpen: say if the teacher should label dev instead of me. Full details are in [step-2C.1.md](/Users/hotragn/Library/Application%20Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e/step-2C.1.md).\n\nNot done: the page doesn't highlight lexicon matches; finding text in the page works instead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2028,"cache_read_input_tokens":388487,"output_tokens":563,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2028,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},